  "description": "HYDROFORMED TUBES\n\nMade with 7005 aluminium, with hydroformed tubes that give it the clean look of an endurance bike, allowing you to cover unlimited miles. The polished welds give the frame of the Quartz SL an even more immaculate look.\n\nOPTIMISED GEOMETRY\n\nLa geometría también se ha optimizado, para que manteniendo la esencia de los cuadros BH, sea cómoda para cualquier usuario. Disponible en cuatro tallas. Incorpora cierres Thru Axle integrados y sistema de frenado de disco Flat Mount.\n\nCARBON FORK\n\nThe fork is made of carbon to achieve a lower weight and greater riding comfort, eliminating the vibrations from the ground.\n\nHIDDEN LEVER LOCKS\n\nThe 12 mm thru-axle is the optimal size to provide increased stiffness and safety. It optimises the position of the disc brake. And it doesn't require tools if the cyclist needs to remove the wheel.",
